    {
      "Id": "systems",
      "Sidebar title": "Systems",
      "Commands": [
        "systems",
        "sys"
      ],
      "Tabs": [
        {
          "Title": "Systems",
          "Columns": [
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "ECONOMY",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "/shop and /store open the Nightshade Market. Listings are priced in ServerRewards RP.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "RP is the player currency. Activity rewards deposit RP. Economics rewards are off, and the ServerRewards exchange tab is off.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "The Admin Shop tab is item barter: fish and components trade for Blood, and the Blood Market spends Blood. It is not a second cash currency.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "There is no separate Black Market currency. The shop card named Black Market: MLRS Truck is an RP purchase.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Shop stock is whatever is saved in the Nightshade Market. It does not rotate on its own.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "The balance on Home is ServerRewards CheckPoints. If that call does not answer, it shows -.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Heading": "LOOT PROTECTION",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Kills, crates, drops, and event rewards may lock to the player or team that earned them.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Use /share when you want another player to access protected loot.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "If a protected container says no, believe it.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "warn"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "QUARRIES / PROGRESSION",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "/vq opens Virtual Quarries when enabled.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Skill Tree unlocks long-term bonuses and progression perks.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Heading": "VEHICLES / QOL",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Car chassis are bought with RP from /shop and built at the car lift.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "The 4-socket chassis is a one-per-wipe RP listing in the VIP shop category. It grants craftchassis.4 until wipe.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "/tug and /tugboat are the VIPx vehicle license. Buying a tugboat with resources is available to the default group, so it is not VIP-only.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Chest stacks: 2 small and 3 large by default. VIP raises both to 5.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "VIP has no decay on personal boats and tugboats.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Use /limits before the server starts judging your decor.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
