        {
          "Title": "Hordes",
          "Commands": [
            "hordehelp",
            "hordeshelp"
          ],
          "Columns": [
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "HORDES HELP",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Hordes are Defendable Homes style wave events. Build smart, check your foundations, then try not to become part of the furniture.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Your Defendable Home must be built on normal terrain using owned square or triangle foundations.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Foundations must belong to you or your team, friends, or clan.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "You must be inside the Tool Cupboard area of the house when checking.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Invalid areas include monuments, cliffs, mountains, clutter or decor terrain, and bad topology.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Do not build too close to another active Defendable Homes event.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Use /checkfoundations to check all foundations for the event.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "⊘ You or friends are not the foundation owner.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "muted"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "⊝ Foundation height or depth does not match.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "muted"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "⊛ Terrain topology is invalid. Prohibited: Cliff, Cliffside, Decor, Building, Monument, Clutter, Mountain.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "muted"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "◉ Foundation is within 40m of a custom monument.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "muted"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Bring ammo, meds, armor, and room in your inventory.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Do not drag hordes into player bases, vendors, safe builds, or random bystanders.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "PvP only applies if the event area is marked PvP, the weekend window is open, or the server is in Purge.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Loot ownership follows Loot Protection and event rules.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "Show status": false,
          "About": [],
          "Rules title": null,
          "Rules": [],
          "Discord title": null,
          "Discord lines": [],
          "Discord invite": null,
          "Buttons": []
        },
        {
          "Title": "Raidable Bases",
          "Commands": [
            "rbinfo",
            "raidablebasesinfo"
          ],
          "Columns": [
            {
              "Blocks": [
                {
                  "Heading": "RAIDABLE BASES",
                  "Lines": [
                    {
                      "Text": "Raidable Bases are event bases. They are not normal player bases, and normal player bases stay protected outside Purge or approved raid events.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Easy: available immediately.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Medium: 24h after wipe. A 12h override exists, but that permission is not on the VIP group.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Hard: 72h after wipe. The 48h override is the same story.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Expert: 120h after wipe. The 96h override is not granted with VIP.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Nightmare: 168h after wipe. The 144h override is not granted with VIP.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "Do not interfere with another player's PvE raid unless event rules allow it.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "PvP raid bases, PvP domes, the weekend window, and Purge are different. Read the warnings.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    },
                    {
                      "Text": "If you started it, finish it before the server starts spawning consequences with your name on them.",
                      "Tone (body, accent, warn, muted)": "body"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
